bomd.message.gauntlet.reward_created=§6[BOMD] §fThe Gauntlet energy formed a chest, five ancient-debris veins, and 1000 experience points.
bomd.message.gauntlet.already_active=§c[BOMD] This arena’s Nether Gauntlet is already active.
bomd.message.gauntlet.spawn_failed=§c[BOMD] The Nether Gauntlet could not be summoned.
bomd.message.gauntlet.prison_opens=§6[BOMD] §fThe blackstone prison breaks apart. Strike the open eye to awaken the Nether Gauntlet.
bomd.function.gauntlet.build_arena=§6[BOMD] §fOriginal arena loaded. Break one of the four outer runic blocks in the central cross to awaken the boss.
bomd.function.gauntlet.build_test_arena=§6[BOMD] §fTemporary arena built. Use /function bomd/nether_gauntlet/spawn.
bomd.function.gauntlet.help.1=§6[BOMD Nether Gauntlet 1.5.4] §fIt appears in Java's open-hand idle pose. Only the eye takes damage; it remains still until the first valid hit; then it holds combat height relative to the player instead of climbing artificially.
bomd.function.gauntlet.help.2=§7Physical eye windows: punch closed on ticks 7–63; swirl 7–59; blindness 10–42. During laser and idle, the eye remains exposed.
bomd.function.gauntlet.help.3=§7Attacks: punch; laser below 85% health; swirl below 70%; blindness below 50%.
bomd.function.gauntlet.help.4=§7/function bomd/nether_gauntlet/build_arena — loads the arena. /function bomd/nether_gauntlet/test_vulnerability — tests the eye. /function bomd/nether_gauntlet/smoke_test — full test.
bomd.function.gauntlet.help.5=§cHUD: §fsix-segment red bar with a Blazing Eye; marks at 85%, 70%, and 50% show laser, swirl, and blindness unlocks.
bomd.function.gauntlet.help.6=§7Combat 1.5.4: Behavior Pack animations and controllers own every attack milestone; JavaScript selects targets and resolves navigation, swept hitboxes, projectiles, explosions, and rewards. Version 1.5.4 corrects altitude and increases Gauntlet responsiveness.
bomd.function.gauntlet.smoke.1=§eTest 1.5.4: §fenter Survival, awaken the boss through the open eye, and verify one hybrid timeline pulse for every physical milestone without duplicate attacks.
bomd.function.gauntlet.smoke.2=§eVulnerability: §faim at the visible eye. Hitting the body must not lower the bar. When the fist closes during punch, swirl, or blindness, damage must be deflected.
bomd.function.gauntlet.smoke.3=§7The laser unlocks below 85% health, deals Java-equivalent 12 attack damage, follows an eight-tick target history, and drills one permitted impact block every two ticks.
bomd.function.gauntlet.smoke.4=§7After defeating it, wait 50 ticks: five netherrack paths, ancient debris, a chest with a Blazing Eye, and 1000 XP.
bomd.function.gauntlet.spawn=§6[BOMD] §fThe Nether Gauntlet appeared dormant. Strike its open eye to begin the encounter.
bomd.function.gauntlet.test_assets=§6[BOMD] §fAsset test: Blazing Eye given and charge sound played.
bomd.function.gauntlet.test_reward=§6[BOMD] §fTest started. After 50 ticks, a chest, five ancient debris blocks, and 1000 XP should appear.
bomd.function.gauntlet.test_vulnerability.1=§6[BOMD] §fVulnerability test started. Hit the body first: health must not drop. Then aim at the front eye: that hit must awaken it.
bomd.function.gauntlet.test_vulnerability.2=§7During punch, swirl, and casting, wait until the hand opens again. The laser leaves the eye exposed.
bomd.function.lich.build_test_arena=§b[BOMD] §fTemporary arena built. Use /function bomd/night_lich/spawn.
bomd.function.lich.build_tower.1=§b[BOMD] §fOriginal Night Lich Tower built. Its chests and guardians will initialize shortly.
bomd.function.lich.build_tower.2=§7Obtain four Soul Stars—one per 50 valid kills—or use /function bomd/night_lich/give_soul_stars to test the ritual.
bomd.function.lich.cleanup=§b[BOMD] §fBosses, projectiles, and summons removed.
bomd.function.lich.give_soul_stars=§b[BOMD] §fYou received four Soul Stars to test the altars.
bomd.function.lich.help.1=§b[BOMD] §fNight Lich 1.5.4 Hybrid Public Beta (Beta APIs required): Behavior Pack timelines now drive comets, missiles, minions, teleport, and rage while JavaScript resolves targeting and spawning.
bomd.function.lich.help.2=§7/function bomd/night_lich/progression shows loot and recipes; /function bomd/night_lich/test_items gives the test items.
bomd.function.lich.progression.1=§b[BOMD] §fHow to obtain Soul Stars
bomd.function.lich.progression.2=§7Each player receives a Soul Star after 50 valid kills. The counter is personal and awards another at 100, 150, 200...
bomd.function.lich.progression.3=§7Use it in the air to point toward the nearest tower, or place one in each of the four altars to summon the Night Lich.
bomd.function.lich.progression.4=§d[BOMD] §fExact Night Lich loot
bomd.function.lich.progression.5=§7Drops 2 Ancient Anima, 3–6 bones, 5–7 diamonds, five level-30 enchanted books, and 1500 XP.
bomd.function.lich.progression.6=§7Ancient Anima has no active use: it is a rare crafting material, as in Java.
bomd.function.lich.progression.7=§b[BOMD] §fTable of Elevation
bomd.function.lich.progression.8=§7Recipe: Ancient Anima at the top; gold, Blazing Eye, gold in the middle; three obsidian at the bottom.
bomd.function.lich.progression.9=§7When placed, it creates a 7 × 7 flight column at any height. Jump to ascend and sneak to descend.
bomd.function.lich.smoke.1=§b[BOMD] §fTest created: inspect the items, altar, Table of Elevation, and Night Lich animations.
bomd.function.lich.smoke.2=§eImportant: §fthe boss only targets players in Survival or Adventure.
bomd.function.lich.smoke.3=§6Head test: §fwalk in front of the Night Lich and then to both sides. The skull should track you without remaining offset.
bomd.function.lich.spawn=§8The air freezes. §bThe Night Lich §8has awakened.
bomd.function.lich.test_items=§b[BOMD] §fProgression items given. Place the Table of Elevation and enter its 7 × 7 column.
