bomd.function.debug.help.1=§b[BOMD Debug 1.5.4] §fVisualize combat and inspect hybrid timeline pulses with /scriptevent bomd:debug gauntlet_hitboxes, movement, laser, lich_projectiles, or teleport.
bomd.function.debug.help.2=§7Use record_start and record_stop to write raw combat data and aggregate movement-equivalence metrics to the Content Log.
