bomd.locator.help.1=§b[BOMD Locator 1.5.4] §fCommands are available only to Creative operators.
bomd.locator.help.2=§7/bomd:find_structure night_lich coords §f— shows the closest registered tower coordinates.
bomd.locator.help.3=§7/bomd:find_structure nether_gauntlet coords §f— shows the closest registered arena coordinates.
bomd.locator.help.4=§7Add §etp §fat the end to teleport: /bomd:find_structure night_lich tp.
bomd.locator.help.5=§7The Soul Star can resolve a Night Lich Tower without prior exploration. The command uses the persistent registry; Nether Gauntlet arenas still register when discovered.
